@HostAddress = http://localhost:5182

### Login
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@philcare.local",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### Get current user (replace {{token}} with the accessToken from login)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get all lookups
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/lookups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get lookups by category
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/lookups/fund_type
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Finance module ---

### List funds (master: ZAKA-FUND, SADA-FUND, GENE-FUND, REST-FUND, OPER-FUND, CAPX-FUND)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/funds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List funding buckets (live balances)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/funding-buckets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List funding buckets for one fund
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/funding-buckets?fundCode=ZAKA-FUND
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get funding bucket detail (replace {{bucketId}})
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/funding-buckets/{{bucketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create donor (with KYD/AML fields)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/donors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Human Appeal Australia",
  "type": "Organization",
  "email": "contact@humanappeal.org.au",
  "country": "Australia",
  "riskRating": "Low",
  "pepFlag": false,
  "privacyConsent": true
}

### List donors
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/donors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get donor detail (replace {{donorId}})
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/donors/{{donorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update donor (e.g. clear KYD after review)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/donors/{{donorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Human Appeal Australia",
  "type": "Organization",
  "email": "contact@humanappeal.org.au",
  "country": "Australia",
  "isActive": true,
  "kydStatus": "Cleared",
  "riskRating": "Low",
  "pepFlag": false,
  "privacyConsent": true
}

### Create zakat donation — auto-splits into ZAK-PROG (program) + ZAK-AMIL (12.5% cap)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/donations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "donorId": 1,
  "amountOriginal": 10000,
  "currency": "PHP",
  "fxRateToPhp": 1,
  "dateReceived": "2026-07-20T00:00:00Z",
  "channel": "Bank Transfer",
  "fundCode": "ZAKA-FUND",
  "adminAllowed": true,
  "adminRateInput": 0.125
}

### Create foreign-currency general donation — auto-converts to PHP, splits program/admin (cap 15%)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/donations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "donorId": 1,
  "amountOriginal": 100,
  "currency": "USD",
  "fxRateToPhp": 58,
  "dateReceived": "2026-07-20T00:00:00Z",
  "channel": "Bank Transfer",
  "fundCode": "GENE-FUND",
  "adminAllowed": true,
  "adminRateInput": 0.15
}

### List donations (filters: donorId, fundCode, from, to, includeVoided)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/donations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get donation detail incl. allocation lines (replace {{donationId}})
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/donations/{{donationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Void donation (Admin only; blocked if its funds are already spent)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/donations/{{donationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create zakat expense (requires zakatAsnaf + beneficiaryCount against ZAK-PROG)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expenseDate": "2026-07-20T00:00:00Z",
  "payeeVendor": "Local Relief Committee",
  "expenseCategory": "RELIEF_DISTRIBUTION",
  "description": "Relief goods distribution",
  "paymentMethod": "CASH",
  "amountOriginal": 2000,
  "currency": "PHP",
  "fxRateToPhp": 1,
  "fundingBucketCode": "ZAK-PROG",
  "zakatAsnaf": "FUQARA",
  "beneficiaryCount": 40
}

### List expenses (filters: fundingBucketCode, expenseCategory, from, to, includeVoided)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get expense detail (replace {{expenseId}})
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Void expense (Admin only; restores bucket balance)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Fund summary report — every bucket's allocated/expensed/remaining + overall admin ratio
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reports/fund-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin recovery control report — per admin/amil bucket cap vs allocated vs expensed
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reports/admin-recovery
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Zakat & Amil control report
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reports/zakat-amil
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Zakat asnaf report — amounts + beneficiary counts by the 8 asnaf categories
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reports/zakat-asnaf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Donor utilization report (replace {{donorId}})
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reports/donor-utilization/{{donorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restricted fund ledger — opening balance + movements for ZAKA-FUND / REST-FUND / CAPX-FUND
### (income allocations now appear as "INC-{id}"; donations as "DON-{id}")
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reports/restricted-ledger?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Other Income module (Sprint 4) ---
### Non-donation inflows — capital/investment returns, grants, waqf/endowment, etc (see income_type
### lookup). Unlike donations, the full amount allocates 100% into ONE chosen funding bucket — no
### program/admin split. Cannot target a zakat fund bucket (zakat money enters only via donations).

### Record capital income (rental/investment/asset returns) into the Capital fund bucket
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/other-income
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "incomeType": "CAPITAL_INCOME",
  "source": "Rental income - PhilCare office annex",
  "dateReceived": "2026-07-20T00:00:00Z",
  "amountOriginal": 50000,
  "currency": "PHP",
  "fxRateToPhp": 1,
  "fundingBucketCode": "CAPX-FUND",
  "receiptNo": "INC-2026-001"
}

### Example: targeting a zakat bucket is rejected (400 OtherIncome.ZakatFundNotAllowed)
# POST {{HostAddress}}/api/other-income
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "incomeType": "GRANT",
#   "source": "Should be rejected",
#   "dateReceived": "2026-07-20T00:00:00Z",
#   "amountOriginal": 10000,
#   "currency": "PHP",
#   "fxRateToPhp": 1,
#   "fundingBucketCode": "ZAK-PROG"
# }

### List other income (filters: incomeType, fundingBucketCode, from, to, includeVoided)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/other-income
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get other income detail incl. allocation line (replace {{incomeId}})
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/other-income/{{incomeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Void other income (Admin only; blocked if its bucket's funds are already spent)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/other-income/{{incomeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Income summary report — total by income_type (optional ?year=)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reports/income-summary?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Programs module ---

### Create program
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/programs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Emergency Relief",
  "category": "RELIEF",
  "ownerDepartment": "Programs Department"
}

### List programs
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/programs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get program detail (replace {{programId}})
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/programs/{{programId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create project under a program (fundType instead of a direct fund/donor link — see project_fund_type lookup)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "programId": 1,
  "name": "2026 Flood Response",
  "fundType": "INTERNAL_FUND",
  "totalBudget": 500000,
  "targetBeneficiaries": 2000,
  "location": "Marikina City"
}

### List projects (filters: programId, implementationStatus, includeInactive)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a donor to a project (a project can have several)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/donors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "donorId": 1
}

### List a project's donors
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/donors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create activity under a project
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": 1,
  "name": "Food Pack Distribution - Batch 1",
  "activityType": "RELIEF_DISTRIBUTION",
  "region": "NCR",
  "budget": 100000,
  "implementingPartner": "Local Barangay Council"
}

### List activities (filters: projectId, implementationStatus, from, to)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register a beneficiary
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/beneficiaries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Juan Dela Cruz",
  "beneficiaryType": "INDIVIDUAL",
  "gender": "Male",
  "vulnerabilityCategory": "PWD",
  "consentOnFile": true
}

### List beneficiaries (filters: beneficiaryType, status, includeInactive)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/beneficiaries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a staff member to an activity's roster (replace {{activityId}})
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/activities/{{activityId}}/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "staffMemberId": 1,
  "roleInActivity": "Facilitator",
  "attendanceStatus": "PRESENT"
}

### Get activity staff roster
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/activities/{{activityId}}/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create distribution — no beneficiary at creation; recipients are added afterwards via the roster
### (see the two requests below). Zakat asnaf is required up front for a zakat program bucket.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/distributions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "distributionType": "CASH_ASSISTANCE",
  "activityId": 1,
  "fundingBucketCode": "ZAK-PROG",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitValuePhp": 1000,
  "zakatAsnaf": "FUQARA",
  "distributionDate": "2026-07-20T00:00:00Z",
  "fieldVerified": true,
  "receivedConfirmation": true
}

### Add a beneficiary to a distribution's reach roster (replace {{distributionId}}; for a zakat
### program bucket the beneficiary needs an approved, unexpired eligibility matching the asnaf above)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/distributions/{{distributionId}}/beneficiaries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "beneficiaryId": 1,
  "receivedConfirmation": true
}

### Get a distribution's reach roster
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/distributions/{{distributionId}}/beneficiaries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List distributions (filters: beneficiaryId, activityId, distributionType, from, to, includeVoided)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/distributions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Program summary report
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reports/program-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Distribution summary report
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reports/distribution-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

