### --- People module ---
### Person is the shared identity for Staff, Volunteer and Membership profiles — see the
### Staff/Volunteers/Memberships sections below, and Governance for Assignments.

### Create person
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/people
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Maria Santos",
  "personCategory": "MEMBER",
  "gender": "Female",
  "contactNumber": "09171234567",
  "defaultVotingRights": false
}

### List people (filters: personCategory, status, includeInactive)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/people
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get person detail (replace {{personId}})
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/people/{{personId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registering the same person again is a soft-warn — expect 409 Beneficiaries.PossibleDuplicate,
### then retry with confirmDuplicate: true
# POST {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/people
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "fullName": "Maria Santos", "personCategory": "MEMBER", "gender": "Female", "contactNumber": "09171234567", "defaultVotingRights": false, "confirmDuplicate": true }

### Deactivate person (Admin only)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/people/{{personId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Staff module ---
### A staff profile attaches to an existing Person — identity (name/contact/photo) lives there.

### Add a staff profile (replace {{personId}})
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personId": 1,
  "position": "Program Officer",
  "department": "HUMANITARIAN_PROGRAMS_DEPARTMENT",
  "employmentType": "FULL_TIME"
}

### List staff (filters: department, employmentType, search, includeInactive)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get staff detail (replace {{staffId}})
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deactivate staff member (Admin only)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Volunteers module ---
### A volunteer profile likewise attaches to an existing Person.

### Add a volunteer profile (replace {{personId}})
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/volunteers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personId": 1,
  "orientationCompleted": true,
  "orientationDate": "2026-06-01T00:00:00Z",
  "codeOfConductSigned": true,
  "codeOfConductDate": "2026-06-01T00:00:00Z",
  "policeClearanceOnFile": true
}

### List volunteers (filters: status, orientationCompleted, includeInactive)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/volunteers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get volunteer detail (replace {{volunteerId}})
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/volunteers/{{volunteerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Enroll a volunteer into an activity (blocked with 400 if the activity has a SafeguardingRisk
### and the volunteer's OrientationCompleted is false — replace {{activityId}})
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/activities/{{activityId}}/volunteers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "volunteerId": 1,
  "roleInActivity": "Logistics Coordinator"
}

### Get activity volunteer roster
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/activities/{{activityId}}/volunteers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deactivate volunteer (Admin only)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/volunteers/{{volunteerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

