POST {{HostAddress}}/api/sponsorships
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "donorId": 1,
  "beneficiaryId": 1,
  "sponsorshipType": "CHILD",
  "monthlyAmountPhp": 1500,
  "startDate": "2026-07-01T00:00:00Z",
  "caseWorker": "Aisha Rahman"
}

### List sponsorships (filters: donorId, beneficiaryId, status, sponsorshipType)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/sponsorships
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get sponsorship detail (replace {{sponsorshipId}})
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/sponsorships/{{sponsorshipId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change sponsorship status (Active -> Paused / Ended, Paused -> Active / Ended)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/sponsorships/{{sponsorshipId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Paused"
}

### Sponsorship summary report
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reports/sponsorship-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Zakat Eligibility workflow (Sprint 4) ---

### Create zakat eligibility case (starts as Draft)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/zakat-eligibilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "beneficiaryId": 1,
  "asnafCategory": "FUQARA",
  "monthlyIncomePhp": 3000,
  "householdSize": 4,
  "assessmentDate": "2026-07-20T00:00:00Z",
  "assessedBy": "Case Worker A"
}

### List zakat eligibility cases (filters: beneficiaryId, status, asnaf)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/zakat-eligibilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get zakat eligibility detail (replace {{eligibilityId}})
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/zakat-eligibilities/{{eligibilityId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Submit case for approval (Draft -> Submitted)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/zakat-eligibilities/{{eligibilityId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve case (Admin only; ValidUntil defaults to +12 months if omitted)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/zakat-eligibilities/{{eligibilityId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approve": true,
  "decidedBy": "Admin Reviewer",
  "validUntil": "2027-07-20T00:00:00Z"
}

### Reject case (Admin only; rejectionReason required)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/zakat-eligibilities/{{eligibilityId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approve": false,
  "decidedBy": "Admin Reviewer",
  "rejectionReason": "Household income exceeds asnaf threshold."
}

### --- Governance module (Sprint 5) ---
### Sourced from the org's real "Enhanced System v7.2" workbook. Board/Executive rosters are NOT
### separate entities — they are derived from Assignments; see GET .../bodies/{id}/members below.

### Create org body (top of the hierarchy — General Assembly)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/bodies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "General Assembly",
  "bodyType": "MEMBERSHIP_SUPREME_BODY",
  "quorumRule": "30% annual; 40% emergency",
  "decisionThreshold": "50% + 1 ordinary; 2/3 strategic decisions",
  "meetingFrequency": "Annual + emergency",
  "policyBasis": "GA Manual 2025"
}

### Create child org body (Board of Trustees, reporting to the General Assembly — replace parentBodyId)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/bodies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Board of Trustees",
  "bodyType": "GOVERNANCE",
  "parentBodyId": 1,
  "quorumRule": "50% + 1",
  "decisionThreshold": "Simple majority; 75% for strategic decisions",
  "meetingFrequency": "Monthly / Quarterly / As needed",
  "policyBasis": "Governance Manual 2025"
}

### Rejected: a body cannot be made its own ancestor (uncomment and adjust ids to try)
# PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/bodies/1
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "name": "General Assembly", "bodyType": "MEMBERSHIP_SUPREME_BODY", "parentBodyId": 2, "isActive": true }
# --> 400 Governance.CircularBodyHierarchy (body 2's parent is body 1)

### List org bodies (filters: bodyType, includeInactive)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/bodies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get org body detail (child bodies + current member count; replace {{bodyId}})
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/bodies/{{bodyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get the body's current roster — THIS is "board trustees" / "executive team", derived from Assignments
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/bodies/{{bodyId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Same roster including former (ended) assignments
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/bodies/{{bodyId}}/members?includeFormer=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deactivate org body (Admin only; 409 if it has active child bodies or current assignments)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/bodies/{{bodyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create governance role
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chairperson",
  "roleCategory": "BOARD",
  "defaultVotingRights": "Yes",
  "countsForQuorum": "Yes",
  "delegable": "No"
}

### List governance roles (filter: roleCategory, includeInactive)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create assignment (person holds a role in a body — replace ids)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personId": 1,
  "orgBodyId": 2,
  "governanceRoleId": 1,
  "positionTitle": "Chairperson",
  "startDate": "2022-10-30T00:00:00Z",
  "isPrimary": true,
  "votingRights": true,
  "isTemporary": false
}

### Rejected: a person cannot hold two primary Current assignments at once (uncomment to try)
# POST {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/assignments
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "personId": 1, "orgBodyId": 3, "governanceRoleId": 1, "startDate": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "isPrimary": true, "votingRights": true, "isTemporary": false }
# --> 409 Governance.DuplicatePrimaryAssignment

### List assignments (filters: personId, bodyId, roleId, status)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### End an assignment (Admin only; endDate optional, defaults to today)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/end
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Create meeting (quorumRequired/decisionThreshold are snapshot-copied from the body automatically)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/meetings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orgBodyId": 2,
  "meetingType": "BOARD_STRATEGIC",
  "meetingDate": "2026-03-25T00:00:00Z",
  "mode": "IN_PERSON",
  "calledBy": "Board Chairperson",
  "chairPersonId": 1
}

### List meetings (filters: bodyId, meetingType, status, from, to)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/meetings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get meeting detail (replace {{meetingId}})
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/meetings/{{meetingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark a meeting Held (required before minutes can be recorded)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/meetings/{{meetingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "meetingType": "BOARD_STRATEGIC",
  "meetingDate": "2026-03-25T00:00:00Z",
  "mode": "IN_PERSON",
  "status": "Held"
}

### Add a meeting participant
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/meetings/{{meetingId}}/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personId": 1,
  "attendanceStatus": "PRESENT",
  "votingRight": true,
  "countsForQuorum": true
}

### Get meeting roster
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/meetings/{{meetingId}}/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get quorum count — reports numbers alongside the snapshotted policy rule, does not evaluate it
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/meetings/{{meetingId}}/quorum
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create minutes (meeting must be Held; one set of minutes per meeting)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/meetings/{{meetingId}}/minutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "preparedByPersonId": 2,
  "approvedByPersonId": 1,
  "summary": "The 2026-2028 Strategic Plan approved."
}

### Rejected: minutes on a meeting that hasn't been held yet (uncomment to try against a Scheduled meeting)
# POST {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/meetings/{{meetingId}}/minutes
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {}
# --> 400 Governance.MeetingNotHeld

### Add a decision to the minutes (replace {{minutesId}})
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/minutes/{{minutesId}}/decisions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decisionText": "Approve the 2026-2028 Strategic Plan.",
  "actionPoints": "Submit to Maktab Tanfizi.",
  "decisionStatus": "OPEN"
}

### List decisions for a minutes record
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/minutes/{{minutesId}}/decisions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Publish minutes (locks minutes AND its decisions from further edits)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/governance/meetings/{{meetingId}}/minutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "summary": "The 2026-2028 Strategic Plan approved.",
  "publicationStatus": "Published"
}

### Governance summary report (filters: from, to — date range on meetings held)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reports/governance-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

